WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:15.189
no!" cried Ben.

2
00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:17.251
"Something happened to Waldo!"

3
00:00:18.071 --> 00:00:22.254
He tried to continue floating through the door of the science lab, but he was stuck.

4
00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.596
Ben cringed from embarrassment.

5
00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:29.940
Here he was—stuck halfway through a door—with everybody looking at him!

6
00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:32.917
"What happened to Waldo?"

7
00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:33.957
called Mr.

8
00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:38.739
Freaky. Ben tried to answer, but the science lab was soundproof.

9
00:00:39.379 --> 00:00:41.860
So no one could hear Ben yelling back to Mr.

10
00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.762
Freaky. Then suddenly—crash!

11
00:00:45.422 --> 00:00:49.304
The door was ripped off its hinges, and Gaby stormed into the lab.

12
00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.785
Ben landed hard on the floor.

13
00:00:57.147 --> 00:00:57.847
Gaby cried.

14
00:00:57.867 --> 00:00:59.448
"What happened to you?

15
00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.401
Waldo, please wake up!"

16
00:01:02.481 --> 00:01:05.243
Mr. Freaky and the human adults rushed into the room.

17
00:01:05.263 --> 00:01:08.425
"Someone get the school nurse!"

18
00:01:08.965 --> 00:01:10.106
Mr. Freaky shouted.

19
00:01:11.066 --> 00:01:13.507
Mog and some other students stood in the doorway.

20
00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:20.151
Minutes later the nurse slipped through the crowd.

21
00:01:20.171 --> 00:01:24.353
"Excuse me, dear," she said to Gaby.

22
00:01:25.494 --> 00:01:27.235
Gaby backed away as Mrs.

23
00:01:27.315 --> 00:01:28.876
Germ checked Waldo's pulse.

24
00:01:33.484 --> 00:01:36.706
The nurse opened one of Waldo's eyes and shined a light in it.

25
00:01:36.726 --> 00:01:41.889
"He'll be fine," she declared.

26
00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.971
Ben was relieved that Waldo was okay.

27
00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:50.954
He was also relieved that nobody was talking about how he'd gotten stuck in the door.

28
00:01:54.876 --> 00:01:56.717
Waldo opened his eyes and moaned.

29
00:01:56.737 --> 00:02:00.359
"Oh What's going on?

30
00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:01.800
Where am I?"

31
00:02:03.552 --> 00:02:05.773
"You're in the science lab," said Mr.

32
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.874
Freaky. "Can you tell us what happened to you?"

33
00:02:10.074 --> 00:02:11.774
Waldo sat up and rubbed his head.

34
00:02:16.456 --> 00:02:19.957
last thing I remember, I was standing in here, waiting for Deb."

35
00:02:19.977 --> 00:02:24.098
"Deb?" cried Mog and Gaby at the same time.

36
00:02:24.118 --> 00:02:27.259
"Um, yeah," said Waldo.

37
00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:30.220
"She offered to help me with the experiment."

38
00:02:31.372 --> 00:02:33.753
He glanced at the mess on the floor and sighed.

39
00:02:33.773 --> 00:02:37.855
"I guess my experiment is ruined."

40
00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:41.517
"Oh, Waldo," Gaby gushed.

41
00:02:42.237 --> 00:02:43.257
"You don't need her help!

42
00:02:43.818 --> 00:02:45.758
You're so much smarter than she is."

43
00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:48.079
Mog looked insulted.

44
00:02:48.099 --> 00:02:51.461
"What are you talking about?

45
00:02:52.081 --> 00:02:53.482
Deb is super smart!"

46
00:02:54.482 --> 00:02:55.082
He paused.

47
00:02:55.102 --> 00:02:58.404
"But I agree that she doesn't need to help Waldo.

48
00:02:59.368 --> 00:03:01.170
She should just hang out with me today."

49
00:03:02.831 --> 00:03:04.072
Mog scratched his head.

50
00:03:04.092 --> 00:03:06.114
"Where is Deb anyway?"

51
00:03:06.134 --> 00:03:08.796
"And where is Winnie?"

52
00:03:09.256 --> 00:03:10.017
a witch asked.

53
00:03:10.878 --> 00:03:12.279
"I haven't seen her all day."

54
00:03:12.299 --> 00:03:19.485
"Winnie is working on a special assignment for me," said Miss Bungle.

55
00:03:20.226 --> 00:03:21.086
Ben perked up.

56
00:03:21.707 --> 00:03:23.869
Winnie was working on a special assignment?

57
00:03:23.889 --> 00:03:27.532
"Deb never showed up," said Waldo.

58
00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.701
Mr. Freaky wrung his hands.

59
00:03:31.542 --> 00:03:33.523
"We need to find out where Deb is.

60
00:03:34.403 --> 00:03:37.825
Miss Bungle, can you please ask the office ogre to look for Deb?"

61
00:03:37.845 --> 00:03:43.509
"Of course," said the broom flying teacher, who then hurried out of the room.

62
00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.331
Mr. Freaky glanced around the lab.

63
00:03:48.351 --> 00:03:50.673
"Waldo, do you remember anything else?"

64
00:03:52.053 --> 00:03:52.934
Waldo nodded.

65
00:03:52.954 --> 00:03:56.416
"Yes, a human girl ran into the lab."

66
00:03:57.372 --> 00:03:59.173
Mayor Hubbletree looked startled.

67
00:03:59.993 --> 00:04:05.335
"What?" "It must be the same girl who ran into the school," Ben put in.

68
00:04:05.355 --> 00:04:06.976
"I saw her too."

69
00:04:06.996 --> 00:04:09.037
"You did?"

70
00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:09.917
said Mr.

71
00:04:09.957 --> 00:04:12.238
Freaky. Ben nodded.

72
00:04:12.258 --> 00:04:14.819
"About Winnie, though, do you know where—?"

73
00:04:14.839 --> 00:04:16.380
"I don't believe it!"

74
00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.201
Mayor Hubbletree interrupted.

75
00:04:18.221 --> 00:04:19.561
"You heard Ms.

76
00:04:19.661 --> 00:04:20.542
Prim, Freaky.

77
00:04:20.662 --> 00:04:22.162
None of our students is missing."

78
00:04:22.182 --> 00:04:26.184
"A human was in here," Waldo insisted.

79
00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.941
"She seemed really scared and confused."

80
00:04:31.141 --> 00:04:32.622
The mayor folded his arms.

81
00:04:32.642 --> 00:04:34.302
"Can you blame her?

82
00:04:34.942 --> 00:04:36.643
This place gives me the creeps."

83
00:04:37.703 --> 00:04:38.783
Waldo continued.

84
00:04:38.803 --> 00:04:43.105
"I asked her who she was and what she was doing here, but she wouldn't tell me.

85
00:04:44.465 --> 00:04:47.906
She said something like, 'I don't understand what's going on.'

86
00:04:48.826 --> 00:04:50.967
Then she saw her reflection and shrieked.

87
00:04:52.527 --> 00:04:54.148
I don't remember anything after that."

88
00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:57.742
Gaby's face grew red with anger.

89
00:04:57.762 --> 00:05:00.985
"Whoever that girl is, she must have knocked you out!

90
00:05:02.246 --> 00:05:06.830
If I ever get my hands on her, I'll—" "This is outrageous!"

91
00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:08.351
boomed Mayor Hubbletree.

92
00:05:08.371 --> 00:05:13.456
"The idea that a human would come in here and attack a monster is absurd!"

93
00:05:13.476 --> 00:05:17.659
"Do you think that crazy human hurt Deb too?"

94
00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.180
Mog asked Waldo.

95
00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.262
"Of course not!"

96
00:05:21.803 --> 00:05:23.004
shouted Mayor Hubbletree.

97
00:05:23.752 --> 00:05:26.254
"Everyone knows that it's monsters who attack humans!

98
00:05:27.014 --> 00:05:28.495
Not the other way around!"

99
00:05:29.536 --> 00:05:32.598
Mr. Freaky pulled out a handkerchief and blew his noses.

100
00:05:38.102 --> 00:05:42.826
it was a human, but she didn't mean to hurt Waldo," said Dave.

101
00:05:42.846 --> 00:05:48.149
"After all, I caused the purple spot epidemic by accident.

102
00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.692
Or maybe something went wrong with the experiment."

103
00:05:52.768 --> 00:05:53.709
The mayor nodded.

104
00:05:53.729 --> 00:05:57.873
"Yes, it was probably something to do with the experiment."

105
00:05:58.874 --> 00:06:00.315
Now Waldo looked annoyed.

106
00:06:00.335 --> 00:06:02.637
"My experiment was going fine."

107
00:06:02.657 --> 00:06:08.162
"Was the human wearing a hoodie with a green skull on the back?"

108
00:06:08.563 --> 00:06:09.403
Ben blurted out.

109
00:06:10.464 --> 00:06:11.746
Waldo looked surprised.

110
00:06:11.766 --> 00:06:13.988
"Actually, yes, she was."

111
00:06:14.868 --> 00:06:16.110
Just then Ms.

112
00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.512
Prim came back into the lab with her clipboard.

113
00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.721
"I've done another head count, Mayor.

114
00:06:23.362 --> 00:06:24.683
All of our students are here.

115
00:06:25.264 --> 00:06:26.405
No one is missing."

116
00:06:26.425 --> 00:06:32.410
"There you go, Freaky," said Mayor Hubbletree, looking around at the monsters.

117
00:06:33.992 --> 00:06:36.394
"It wasn't a human who caused this mess.

118
00:06:37.435 --> 00:06:41.018
That means—" "It was a monster!"

119
00:06:41.499 --> 00:06:43.521
Mr. Freaky put his head in his hands.

120
00:06:43.541 --> 00:06:46.723
"Everything is totally out of control!"
